      "body": "Analysts have maintained their fair value estimate for Balrampur Chini Mills at about ₹616 per share. This reflects largely unchanged assumptions on the discount rate, revenue growth, profit margin and future P/E as they reassess the balance between earnings potential and valuation.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
